  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICF_ Small Holder Development Facility to increase economic opportunities for small holder farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technoserve (TNS) manages the CASA Technical Assistance Facility (TAF) in around 15 countries, providing long-term technical assistance to enable larger, investment-ready, and often export-oriented agribusinesses to expand their smallholder supply chains, increase their development impact, and attract further investment. It also provides technical assistance on demand to FCDO Posts, helping them plan and test development work in agri-food value chains and markets.</narrative>
  </description>
